1
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,709
Live football graphics are fast.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:07,483
But they are not always right, they rarely explain themselves, and they do not adapt to who is watching.

3
00:00:07,963 --> 00:00:12,707
Sigma Broadcast turns a synthetic match into a 3D broadcast, built on synthetic data only.

4
00:00:12,777 --> 00:00:15,766
Every graphic is backed by evidence and every decision is recorded.

5
00:00:15,836 --> 00:00:19,150
The difference is separation: truth, direction and bounded AI.

6
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:21,529
MatchTruth is the source of truth.

7
00:00:21,599 --> 00:00:24,848
Deterministic detectors bind every insight to exact event IDs.

8
00:00:24,918 --> 00:00:28,592
When a correction lands, anything that depends on invalid data is withdrawn.

9
00:00:29,072 --> 00:00:30,876
BroadcastSync is the director.

10
00:00:30,946 --> 00:00:36,105
It prioritizes, schedules, expires and resolves conflicts, including broadcast delay.

11
00:00:36,175 --> 00:00:37,864
Nothing stale reaches air.

12
00:00:38,344 --> 00:00:42,068
BroadcastAgent is one bounded agent, backed by two on-device models.

13
00:00:42,138 --> 00:00:46,667
It scores priority and audience, then recommends air, boost, hold or suppress.

14
00:00:46,737 --> 00:00:49,981
Every decision records the evidence, top signal and confidence.

15
00:00:50,051 --> 00:00:51,690
It never creates facts.

16
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:53,829
Follow a club or a player.

17
00:00:53,899 --> 00:00:56,818
The model raises their relevance and the overlay gets a gold border.

18
00:00:56,888 --> 00:00:59,532
Preferences stay local, explicit and synthetic.

19
00:01:00,012 --> 00:01:01,706
The separation is the value.

20
00:01:01,776 --> 00:01:07,390
MatchTruth supplies facts, BroadcastSync directs the airtime, and one bounded agent ranks what deserves attention.

21
00:01:07,460 --> 00:01:11,269
The demo runs entirely in the browser, with no keys and no paid services.

22
00:01:11,339 --> 00:01:16,378
Azure OpenAI, GitHub Models and Azure Functions are optional integrations, not requirements for the demo.

23
00:01:16,858 --> 00:01:21,257
Sigma Broadcast. Deterministic, explainable, personalizable.

24
00:01:21,327 --> 00:01:23,701
The match, intelligently broadcast.
